<body><main class="shell"><header><a class="brand" href="#">GYEOL <span>/ PLAY STUDIES</span></a><span class="edition">01 — CIRCUITS</span></header>
<section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL ROUTE. A COMPLETE CIRCUIT.</p><h1>__TITLE_HTML__</h1><p class="description">Wake every amber node, then carry the signal home.</p></section>
<div class="play-layout"><section class="game-panel" aria-label="Game"><div class="board-caption"><span>FIELD 01</span><span id="phase">Ready to connect</span></div><canvas id="board" width="720" height="400" tabindex="0" aria-label="Signal board. Use arrow keys to move or click an adjacent tile."></canvas><div class="hud"><div><span class="metric-label">NODES</span><strong id="nodes">0 / 3</strong></div><div><span class="metric-label">MOVES</span><strong id="moves">00</strong></div><button id="start">Start circuit <span>↗</span></button></div></section>
<aside><h2>Find the connection.</h2><p>Move along the open paths. Light all three nodes before entering the green terminal.</p><div class="legend"><span><i class="node amber"></i> Wake the node</span><span><i class="node green"></i> Bring it home</span></div><p class="controls"><kbd>↑</kbd><br><kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd><br><span>Arrow keys · or click a neighbour</span></p><div class="trail"><h3>Your trail</h3><p>Keep a route. Play it back, move for move.</p><button id="replay" disabled>Replay trail</button><button id="export" disabled>Export trail</button><label class="file-button" for="import">Import trail<input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json,.json"></label></div></aside></div>
<p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite">Start when you are ready. There is no time limit.</p><footer><span>THINK IN PATHS.</span><span>A standalone Gyeol Engine study</span></footer></main><script type="module" src="/src/main.ts"></script></body></html>
